\section{ML-KEM-1024 Encapsulation}
ML-KEM-1024 provides quantum-resistant key exchange based on 
module learning-with-errors (MLWE). Shared secrets are derived through:
\[
\text{ss} = \text{Decaps}(\text{sk}, \text{ct}).
\]

\section{CKKS Homomorphic Tensor Evolution}
CKKS supports approximate homomorphic arithmetic:
\[
\hat{\Psi}(t+\Delta t) =
\exp\left( -\frac{i}{\hbar} \hat{\mathcal{H}} \Delta t \right)
\circledast \Psi(t),
\]
where $\circledast$ denotes encrypted tensor contraction.

